# Public source-mirror exclusions. The staged release tree is the final allowlist;
# these rules prevent ordinary Git adds from including local engineering material.
/.agents/
/.codex/
/.github/
/.trellis/
/AGENTS.md
/CONTEXT.md
/.gitattributes
/apps/
/crates/support/
/docs/
/examples/
/scripts/
/sessions/
/target/
/Cargo.lock
/results/

# Standalone validation assets are not part of the public source mirror.
**/tests/
**/benches/
**/fixtures/
**/fixture/
*.jsonl
*.jsonl.tmp
**/*.rs.bk
